## Verdict

Passed. `studio/briefs/W-110.md` revision 3 clears all three MUST from the
round-4 prereview (`studio/ci/W-110-spec-4.log`) and takes all four SHOULD.
Nothing is rebutted. Two of the three MUST were introduced by revision 2 and
are my defects, not inherited ones: revision 2's S8 fix derived a column set
that is not in the data, and its ladder interpolated an error string that
carries an absolute path. Both are corrected at the source rather than
